 to be fun, but also to make you look as ridiculous as possible in real life. Half + Half is made to be fun for you, but also fun for everyone in the same room.", "short_description": "Half + Half is a multiplayer game about fun & connection. Glide or Swim through open-ended spaces. Play human tetris with friends, or Hide & Seek where you\u2019re two inches tall."}]}, "developer_name": "Normal", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://normcore.io/legal/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://normcore.io/legal/termsofservice", "publisher_name": "Normal", "support_website_url": "https://halfandhalf.fun/", "website_url": "https://halfandhalf.fun/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EXPLORATION", "PUZZLE", "SOCIAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "1244333839428685"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 6, "nodes": [{"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "837319606685929"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2536730849718970"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "973979182985992"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "441209683264249"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2431637650486904"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "449697965687031"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2431637650486904"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1577250000, "status": "CANCELLED", "id": "837319606685929"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinar